FocusLoop uses Gemma models.

Gemma is provided under and subject to the Gemma Terms of Use found at
https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms

Use of Gemma is also subject to the Gemma Prohibited Use Policy:
https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy

FocusLoop does not redistribute Gemma model files. In Private Mode the
browser downloads them from the onnx-community/gemma-3-1b-it-ONNX repository
on Hugging Face (or from a host configured by whoever deploys FocusLoop).

Fonts bundled in public/fonts:
- Fraunces, Copyright The Fraunces Project Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1
